### Workflow Files

#### [DELETE] [`pre-deploy.yml`](file:///c:/Users/Ranganathan.9703/Documents/learning/.github/workflows/pre-deploy.yml)
Merged into the unified pipeline.

#### [DELETE] [`deploy.yml`](file:///c:/Users/Ranganathan.9703/Documents/learning/.github/workflows/deploy.yml)
Merged into the unified pipeline.

#### [DELETE] [`post-deploy.yml`](file:///c:/Users/Ranganathan.9703/Documents/learning/.github/workflows/post-deploy.yml)
Merged into the unified pipeline.

#### [NEW] `deploy-pipeline.yml`
**Path:** `.github/workflows/deploy-pipeline.yml`

```yaml
on:
  workflow_dispatch:
    inputs:
      environment:
        type: choice
        options: [staging, production]

jobs:
  pre-deploy:                        # Job 1 — runs immediately
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps: [quality gates + pytest]

  deploy:
    needs: pre-deploy                # blocked until Job 1 passes
    environment: production          # ← approval gate pauses here
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps: [deploy command]

  post-deploy:
    needs: deploy                    # blocked until Job 2 passes
    environment: production          # ← approval gate pauses here
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps: [smoke tests]
```

---

## Key Behaviour

| Scenario | What happens |
|---|---|
| `pre-deploy` fails | Pipeline stops. `deploy` and `post-deploy` never run. |
| Reviewer rejects approval | That job is cancelled. Pipeline stops. |
| `deploy` fails | `post-deploy` never runs. |
| All pass | Full pipeline completes. Production is verified. |

