## Verification Plan

1. Push to feature branch → merge to `main`
2. Go to **Actions** → see `deploy-pipeline.yml` with **"Run workflow"** button
3. Click Run → `pre-deploy` job starts immediately
4. After `pre-deploy` passes → confirm **"Waiting for review"** appears on `deploy` job
5. Click Approve → `deploy` runs
6. After `deploy` passes → confirm **"Waiting for review"** appears on `post-deploy` job
7. Click Approve → `post-deploy` runs smoke tests
